{
"file": 251,
"paths": [
"d007/d011/f215"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "effd91d4",
"en_raw": "You're alone, that's rare"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "725adbd9",
"en_raw": "Honestly, the mood lately is awful"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "6f4d76f8",
"en_raw": "What's wrong?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "1308d50a",
"en_raw": "Suspicion breeds fear"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "7c0d9aa2",
"en_raw": "What's that?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "aee4a021",
"en_raw": "That's the atmosphere in our class now"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "166b700e",
"en_raw": "Everyone is suspicious"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "bf6f470d",
"en_raw": "of each other"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "d618ec19",
"en_raw": "Because of some nonsense"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "df3e204d",
"en_raw": "like the Lizard Hand"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "d866931c",
"en_raw": "...Lizard Hand?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "918a3e97",
"en_raw": "It's famous"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "8c00e507",
"en_raw": "Lucky you don't know, Murase"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "e13b18e4",
"en_raw": "It's proof that"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "2911b8f1",
"en_raw": "nobody hates you"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "c762a7ca",
"en_raw": "What does that have to do with it?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "5f7e3124",
"en_raw": "That Lizard Hand and"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "5be9b308",
"en_raw": "being hated by someone..."
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "f9066262",
"en_raw": "It's an ugly story, this one"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "769c802e",
"en_raw": "They say if you put the Lizard Hand"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "b824b799",
"en_raw": "in the desk of someone you hate"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "6b917036",
"en_raw": "that person becomes unlucky"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "852c961a",
"en_raw": "And to escape the bad luck"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "f1a6ea72",
"en_raw": "you have to put it"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "e33e0db4",
"en_raw": "in someone else's desk..."
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "8154c6d9",
"en_raw": "...It just repeats"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "9916ef43",
"en_raw": "Yeah, so I'm waiting"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "4b62ace9",
"en_raw": "If it's in my desk"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "65bf7657",
"en_raw": "I'll tear it apart"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "d3d1107b",
"en_raw": "in front of everyone..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "2d6fc450",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "ad49992d",
"en_raw": "About what we were saying..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "0fde560f",
"en_raw": "Sadly, I have no more info than before"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "9fc226b2",
"en_raw": "...nothing at all"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "ecaddb59",
"en_raw": "If you find out anything, tell me too"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "e1ea508c",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I have something to do..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "1df58ad3",
"en_raw": "See you."
}
]
}